      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This property presents an excellent opportunity for investors, builders, and owner-occupiers seeking a renovation project in a well-established residential location. This mid-terrace property is currently in a derelict condition and requires complete refurbishment throughout, offering purchasers the chance to create a home tailored to their own specifications and requirements.\r\n\r\nThe property qualifies for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, with potential funding of up to €70,000 available to assist with renovation costs, subject to the relevant terms and conditions. The property also qualifies for the Living City Initiative tax relief scheme. \r\n\r\nConveniently located within easy reach of Cork City Centre and a host of local amenities, the property offers significant potential for its new owners."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:                 \r\n      \r\nLiving/dining Room (6.32m X 2.89m)\t\r\n\r\nKitchen (3.20m X 3.06m)\t\t\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.57 X 0.92m)\r\n\r\nDining Room (3.81m X 2.69m)\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.91m X 2.90m)\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (2.94m X 2.90m)"
      },
